1
00:00:07,859 --> 00:00:10,980
Marcus had worked at the same company for 28 years.

2
00:00:11,240 --> 00:00:14,460
He knew every system, every process, every client.

3
00:00:14,859 --> 00:00:16,120
He thought that meant something.

4
00:00:16,359 --> 00:00:21,440
Until the day an algorithm reviewed his file and recommended his position eliminated.

5
00:00:21,820 --> 00:00:27,620
No warning, no conversation, just an algorithm screen deciding his professional future.

6
00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:31,120
He applied for 47 positions in 90 days.

7
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:37,539
He got three interviews, none of them called back 28 years and he was starting over alone.

8
00:00:37,939 --> 00:00:40,479
His company had 28 years warning.

9
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:43,039
They chose the algorithm instead.

10
00:00:43,560 --> 00:00:49,659
What if companies used AI to train their 50 plus employees instead of using it to replace them?

